The Apache Software Foundation (http://www.apache.org/).

This product contains a modified C# port of Apache OpenNLP 1.9.4
(https://opennlp.apache.org/), specifically the opennlp-tools module.
The original Java source is:

    Apache OpenNLP
    Copyright 2017 The Apache Software Foundation

The ported source has been modified from the original: translated from
Java to C#, renamed to the NOpenNLP.Tools namespace, and adapted to .NET
idioms and APIs.

The test suite includes the Prepositional Phrase Attachment Dataset from
Ratnaparkhi, Reynar, & Roukos, "A Maximum Entropy Model for Prepositional
Phrase Attachment". ARPA HLT 1994. The data is licensed under the Apache
License 2.0; please cite the above paper when the data is redistributed.

